    "causal_summary": "Extract the six view-logic seams \u2014 home filter/sort/group, session-card projection, message grouping, draft reconciliation, id+epoch scope-guard, and stale-decay \u2014 as PURE functions over immutable snapshots that each carry session id + host epoch + revision. Each seam gets a differential test (every incremental result equals a canonical full rebuild) and a boundary test (stale / unknown / mismatched data stays visibly unresolved, never promoted to success). Every seam reads existing DTO fields only, so nothing here is blocked on a host field. Plan only; no implementation until the operator says go.",
